1
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:28,419
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,419 --> 00:00:32,131
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,355 --> 00:00:34,600
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,947 --> 00:00:37,654
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,533 --> 00:00:43,061
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,061 --> 00:00:46,693
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,171 --> 00:00:50,659
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,803 --> 00:00:55,299
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,299 --> 00:00:59,939
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,327 --> 00:01:01,987
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:01,987 --> 00:01:07,939
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,131 --> 00:01:11,819
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,819 --> 00:01:15,390
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,555 --> 00:01:22,499
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,947 --> 00:01:26,568
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,568 --> 00:01:30,252
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,339 --> 00:01:35,267
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,267 --> 00:01:39,427
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:46,723
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,267 --> 00:01:49,923
=Episode 8=

21
00:01:58,519 --> 00:01:59,840
(I don't want to get married.)

22
00:02:00,519 --> 00:02:01,840
(Will you take me away, Mr. Rong?)

23
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,240
Please don't take offense.

24
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:13,039
I spoiled Chun'er too much.

25
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:13,879
Don't worry.

26
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:18,439
I'll keep a close eye on her. She won't
run away from the wedding again.

27
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,120
Let's go to the main hall
for a cup of tea and a rest.

28
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:34,360
If Miss Jiang is unwilling,
I don't have to marry her.

29
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,360
- We might as well call it off now.
- Don't be rash.

30
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:43,759
The union between the Governor Mansion
and our family goes beyond this wedding.

31
00:03:02,656 --> 00:03:03,639
Miss Jiang.

32
00:03:05,919 --> 00:03:06,759
Mr. Rong.

33
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:12,320
I know the Governor pushed this match
only for the kingfisher phoenix crown

34
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,080
in Chun'er's dowry.

35
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,680
The kingfisher phoenix crown?

36
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:23,080
I think the Governor mentioned trading
the crown with the Xiaosheng Society.

37
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:29,719
So I hope in the future,
you'll be patient with Chun'er

38
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,919
and support the Jiang family.

39
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:34,159
The world is vast.
There's nowhere we can't go.

40
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,879
Just like in the opera,

41
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:38,800
we can go to river towns in the south
or deserts in the north.

42
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:42,719
I've got enough banknotes
to enjoy ourselves wherever we go.

43
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:46,319
Chun'er, life isn't like the opera.

44
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:47,759
Think it through.

45
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:49,159
I thought it through long ago.

46
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:52,599
I just want to know
if you are willing to be with me.

47
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,400
(I'm sorry, Chun'er.)

48
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:57,520
(I have something I must do.)

49
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,599
(I can only let you down.)

50
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,400
- If you're unwilling...
- Fine.

51
00:04:05,919 --> 00:04:06,719
I'll help you.

52
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:27,680
(He'll kill me once he has the crown.)

53
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:32,920
(And he sent me to find Jade Buddha Head
just to squeeze the last use out of me.)

54
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:38,120
Young Marshal,

55
00:04:38,656 --> 00:04:41,560
as you ordered,
all our men have been assembled.

56
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:46,360
No matter what happens,
we will ensure you get out safely.

57
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:53,000
What I want isn't to just get out safely,
but to hold my fate in my own hands.

58
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:57,800
Since he says I'm like him,
I'll grant his wish.

59
00:04:58,688 --> 00:05:04,680
If he won't give me
the Governor's position, I'll take it.

60
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,439
Young Marshal,

61
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:09,120
we have too few men.
I'm afraid we can't rival the Governor.

62
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:16,319
If we don't fight now, we will die.

63
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:18,079
Understood.

64
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,319
You laughed at me for my unsteady hand.

65
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:39,279
It seems your shooting
isn't all that impressive either.

66
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:44,800
Then would you like to test my shooting?

67
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:55,199
I'm standing very close.
Let's see if I can hit you.

68
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,199
Let's try it then.

69
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,279
Drop your shoulder.

70
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:12,879
Push it forward.

71
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,560
It's not that hard.

72
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:30,240
Let's compete.

73
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:33,279
Sure.

74
00:06:48,896 --> 00:06:51,819
♪A thousand sails gone♪

75
00:06:53,248 --> 00:06:54,360
I hit it.

76
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,519
Draw.

77
00:06:59,079 --> 00:06:59,879
Aim.

78
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,000
Draw.

79
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:03,959
It's fine.

80
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,680
Again.

81
00:07:05,519 --> 00:07:06,279
Draw.

82
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,160
Aim.

83
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,120
Draw.

84
00:07:11,616 --> 00:07:17,120
♪The boat waits in the wind and snow♪

85
00:07:17,721 --> 00:07:21,164
♪Peach petals fall where dreamers go♪

86
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:24,544
♪The moon as before♪

87
00:07:24,992 --> 00:07:28,478
♪A jug of wine in the night rain♪

88
00:07:28,768 --> 00:07:32,096
♪Softly whispers♪

89
00:07:32,431 --> 00:07:34,144
♪No return♪

90
00:07:34,209 --> 00:07:35,744
♪No regret♪

91
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,319
Not that impressive.

92
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:46,000
You're so proud of defeating me,
a beginner at guns?

93
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:53,920
The person who can outshoot me
hasn't even been born yet.

94
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,909
♪I ask why♪

95
00:07:56,909 --> 00:08:00,519
♪I yearn for the one who's gone
through heat and cold♪

96
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,279
The prize for you.

97
00:08:01,792 --> 00:08:03,719
♪A handful of earth♪

98
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,404
♪The world's last gamble♪

99
00:08:06,528 --> 00:08:10,401
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

100
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:17,504
♪No one comes to meet me♪

101
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,279
Xu You'an,

102
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:41,120
will you marry Miss Jiang?

103
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,919
Yes.

104
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,159
But you heard it too.

105
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:48,919
Xu Fan plans to kill you
after your wedding.

106
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:56,919
My life or death
doesn't depend on whether I marry.

107
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,000
Besides,

108
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:06,480
you seem to care quite a lot
about my marriage to Miss Jiang.

109
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,279
Since my master died,

110
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:21,159
she's the only one who's ever
given me everything for nothing.

111
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:26,480
I just hope everything
goes well for her.

112
00:09:28,039 --> 00:09:29,080
What about your parents?

113
00:09:32,879 --> 00:09:33,720
I've never met them.

114
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:38,120
Maybe I have, but I don't remember.

115
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:41,679
In my heart,

116
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:44,480
my master is my parent.

117
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:49,919
I once had a buddy.
And we only had each other.

118
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,960
Where is he?

119
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:59,480
After I joined the Rongqing Troupe,
I never saw him again.

120
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:03,320
I've searched for years
and never found a trace of him.

121
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:10,960
How many orphans in this chaotic world
got to live like I did?

122
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,759
I once had a buddy too.

123
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:22,960
When I finally found him,
he was already dead.

124
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:43,120
If he were still alive,
he would probably look just like you.

125
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:14,200
As long as Xu Fan lives,
he is a threat to everyone.

126
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:19,159
If you can't do it, I will.

127
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:31,200
(If there's a next life, may we
be free of all the entanglements.)

128
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:36,120
(We would surely share a drink
and become true friends.)

129
00:12:00,512 --> 00:12:01,792
♪As if it were fate♪

130
00:12:01,792 --> 00:12:03,149
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

131
00:12:03,711 --> 00:12:06,948
♪We miss each other♪

132
00:12:08,192 --> 00:12:09,760
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

133
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,160
♪And a bizarre♪

134
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,962
♪Anonymous legend♪

135
00:12:15,492 --> 00:12:17,504
♪The plot twists and turns♪

136
00:12:17,652 --> 00:12:19,392
♪Play out over and over again♪

137
00:12:19,392 --> 00:12:22,456
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

138
00:12:23,037 --> 00:12:24,736
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

139
00:12:24,736 --> 00:12:25,728
♪Refuse to submit♪

140
00:12:25,728 --> 00:12:28,928
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

141
00:12:30,592 --> 00:12:33,504
♪There are always too many♪

142
00:12:33,504 --> 00:12:35,392
♪Helpless situations♪

143
00:12:35,392 --> 00:12:38,016
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

144
00:12:39,147 --> 00:12:41,107
♪Even if I have questions♪

145
00:12:41,107 --> 00:12:43,107
♪I harbor desires♪

146
00:12:43,107 --> 00:12:45,984
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

147
00:12:46,335 --> 00:12:47,968
♪People come and go♪

148
00:12:47,968 --> 00:12:50,784
♪I'm still all alone♪

149
00:12:50,784 --> 00:12:53,512
♪Wandering around♪

150
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:56,613
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

151
00:12:56,613 --> 00:13:01,074
♪Go through the entanglement♪

152
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,168
♪If longing♪

153
00:13:03,168 --> 00:13:06,327
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

154
00:13:06,327 --> 00:13:09,082
♪How can I be at ease♪

155
00:13:09,184 --> 00:13:11,498
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

156
00:13:11,616 --> 00:13:13,472
♪And travelled around the world♪

157
00:13:13,568 --> 00:13:16,656
♪Scars all over me♪

158
00:13:16,928 --> 00:13:19,840
♪If longing never fades♪

159
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,289
♪Burns still hot♪

160
00:13:21,289 --> 00:13:24,368
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

161
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,497
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

162
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:27,744
♪In the next life♪

163
00:13:27,744 --> 00:13:32,224
♪Entangle with you again♪
